im-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><li>正式荐票0；模拟盘持仓来源文件截至20260930，目标日实际持仓变化未核验。</li></div></section><section id="temperature"><h2>二 资金温度 · 日度统计(买侧席位明细)</h2><div id="component-FUNDTEMP"><!--FUNDTEMP--><h3>二 资金温度 · 日度统计(买侧席位明细)</h3><div class="hint">柱=当日出手席次(<span style="color:#2e6f5e">■机构</span> <span style="color:#7c5cbf">■量化</span> <span style="color:#c0392b">■游资=活跃(截至昨日累计上榜≥8次,数据驱动)∪知名名单</span>),虚线=买侧总金额(右轴);底部圆点=温度(红热≥67/黄温/蓝冷&lt;34,当日总额在截至当日近60日的分位,零后视镜)。滚动窗口只显示最近20个交易日,日期增加不影响展示。★库实证(清洗后,区分度15.9pp,倒U型):<b>温和放量日(34-66分位)跟买61.6%最好,过热(≥67)仅45.7%,冷48.7%居中</b>=有钱进但不拥挤才有肉。<b>今日温度:72分位(热)</b></div><div class="card"><svg viewBox="0 0 940 300" style="width:100%;height:auto;font-family:inherit"><line x1="46" y1="266" x2="930" y2="266" stroke="#e8e2d4" stroke-width="1"></line><text x="40" y="270" text-anchor="end" font-size="10" fill="#8a8272">0</text><line x1="46" y1="204" x2="930" y2="204" stroke="#e8e2d4" stroke-width="1"></line><text x="40" y="208" text-anchor="end" font-size="10" fill="#8a8272">48</text><line x1="46" y1="142" x2="930" y2="142" stroke="#e8e2d4" stroke-width="1"></line><text x="40" y="146" text-anchor="end" font-size="10" fill="#8a8272">96</text><line x1="46" y1="80" x2="930" y2="80" stroke="#e8e2d4" stroke-width="1"></line><text x="40" y="84" text-anchor="end" font-size="10" fill="#8a8272">144</text><line x1="46" y1="18" x2="930" y2="18" stroke="#e8e2d4" stroke-width="1"></line><text x="40" y="22" text-anchor="end" font-size="10" fill="#8a8272">192</text><rect x="54.0" y="242.8" width="24.3" height="23.2" fill="#2e6f5e"></rect><rect x="54.0" y="233.7" width="24.3" height="9.0" fill="#7c5cbf"></rect><rect x="54.0" y="77.4" width="24.3" height="156.3" fill="#c0392b"></rect><text x="66" y="279" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" fill="#8a8272">09/03</text><circle cx="66" cy="288" r="3" fill="#7f9db9"></circle><rect x="98.2" y="246.6" width="24.3" height="19.4" fill="#2e6f5e"></rect><rect x="98.2" y="235.0" width=