3亿</span></td><td>5<span class="mut">/2.4亿</span></td><td>161<span class="mut">/33.1亿</span></td><td>18<span class="mut">/11.9亿</span></td><td><b>58.4亿</b></td><td><b>12</b></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap">09-29</td><td>22<span class="mut">/6.8亿</span></td><td>11<span class="mut">/4.8亿</span></td><td>131<span class="mut">/31.6亿</span></td><td>22<span class="mut">/12.3亿</span></td><td><b>63.7亿</b></td><td><b>17</b></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap">09-28</td><td>22<span class="mut">/7.9亿</span></td><td>8<span class="mut">/2.7亿</span></td><td>115<span class="mut">/26.2亿</span></td><td>24<span class="mut">/21.8亿</span></td><td><b>63.5亿</b></td><td><b>15</b></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap">09-24</td><td>21<span class="mut">/5.6亿</span></td><td>11<span class="mut">/8.1亿</span></td><td>127<span class="mut">/30.3亿</span></td><td>19<span class="mut">/16.9亿</span></td><td><b>67.4亿</b></td><td><b>20</b></td></tr></table></div>
<!--/FUNDTEMP--></div><div class="card"><div class="" id="claim-lhb-7d06dbc1e895fbe8"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-verdict">结论</span><span class="claim-source">判断 · 结论</span></div><p class="mut">判断 · 结论</p><p>C档防守。本路正式荐票0；观察票不进入交易计划。双源强矛盾7只，且现有正净买候选未满足多席S/A共振与位置可核验的合取条件。目标日市场宽度/官方资金温度未从可用输入核验，故不扩展为全市场情绪判断。缺失值保持null。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-bfefc017b288b190"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">证据 · 来源</span></div><p class="mut">证据 · 来源</p><p>20261008/lhb.csv</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-379e7ee7a421705b"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">证据 · 事实</span></div><p class="mut">证据 · 事实</p><p>原始行82行；剔除非当日榜/转债后按代码去重58只；股票级净买只取当日榜行，同票多原因不累加；不引用上榜后收益列。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-060b43d66e57351d"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">证据 · 来源</span></div><p class="mut">证据 · 来源</p><p>_学习/龙虎榜双源校验_20261008.json</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-cf3bed98fe4c926d"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">证据 · 事实</span></div><p class="mut">证据 · 事实</p><p>状态pass；可比58只，一致25、分歧16、强矛盾7、打折10、仅源29；源2仅买入前五净额，不是完整股票级净买。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-ab19bd8b8693b74f"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">证据 · 来源</span></div><p class="mut">证据 · 来源</p><p>_学习/_席位动向/20261008.csv + _学习/_席位分档.json</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-73aa30e8026771ee"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">证据 · 事实</span></div><p class="mut">证据 · 事实</p><p>剔区间榜并按(代码,席位)最大买入额去重；按S/A净额&gt;0且买额≥1000万元识别7笔/7只，席位净额合计约1.7263亿元（不是股票级净买）；档表训练窗口20260401~20260930。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-653fd620912ac395"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">证据 · 来源</span></div><p class="mut">证据 · 来源</p><p>_学习/_龙虎榜质量库.json</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-3ccb5107f00d9bec"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">证据 · 事实</span></div><p class="mut">证据 · 事实</p><p>净买占比因子状态=有效，窗口20260401~20260708、样本4607；净买占比不是单独荐票条件。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-4ab9c552f49b6f95"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">证据 · 来源</span></div><p class="mut">证据 · 来源</p><p>_学习/龙虎榜双源校验_20261008.json</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-33782681960d9100"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">证据 · 事实</span></div><p class="mut">证据 · 事实</p><p>目标日官方资金温度/机构北向分项未在本路允许输入中核验，全部记为null；不把实时温度缺口当作中性信号。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-cdaa42359c862b12"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">判断 · 档位</span></div><p class="mut">判断 · 档位</p><p>C</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-cdc8ff6390789c09"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">判断 · 置信度</span></div><p class="mut">判断 · 置信度</p><p>62</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-e5cee62405c04c11"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">判断 · 置信度说明</span></div><p class="mut">判断 · 置信度说明</p><p>龙虎榜、席位明细、双源机器校验均覆盖目标日；但官方资金温度/成交额分项缺失，席位档表和质量因子训练窗口止于2026-09-30/2026-07-08，模拟盘状态停留在2026-09-30；因此信心仅中低。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-6ccd58de14c19bf3"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-condition">条件</span><span class="claim-source">判断 · 可证伪条件</span></div><p class="mut">判断 · 可证伪条件</p><p>若下一交易日出现至少2只非近高、位置可核验标的，同时满足股票级当日净买为正、双源判定一致、至少2笔有效S/A出手（净额&gt;0且买额≥1000万元），则本次“缺乏干净共振”被证伪。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-4fd89751eaecaa1b"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-condition">条件</span><span class="claim-source">判断 · 可证伪条件</span></div><p class="mut">判断 · 可证伪条件</p><p>若市场跌停降至5家以内且炸板率低于15%，并有两只通过源1/双源/多席/位置四重门禁的标的，则C档防守需复核；单看龙虎榜买侧金额不能升级。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-285e7ac92f92f01f"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-condition">条件</span><span class="claim-source">判断 · 可证伪条件</span></div><p class="mut">判断 · 可证伪条件</p><p>若缺失的20261008资金温度官方数据被核验并显示机构与北向同向净流入，环境判断需重估，但不自动构成荐票。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-5c6825afb0363815"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-limitation">限制</span><span class="claim-source">判断 · 独立盲区声明</span></div><p class="mut">判断 · 独立盲区声明</p><p>目标日市场总成交额/涨跌停宽度未从允许输入核验；汇总文件采集时点晚于本次cutoff，故排除。官方资金温度/机构/北向分项未核验，FUNDTEMP留空。源2只有买入前五、不能证明完整净买；双源状态虽pass仍含强矛盾。席位分档统计窗口止于20260930，作为滞后历史基准；信号胜率窗口止于20260703，质量库窗口止于20260708。模拟盘状态文件日期为20260930且持仓空，不能确认10/01至10/08间状态是否已变；交易计划因此披露状态陈旧且不臆造持仓。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-b1f368a2017ffa96"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">验证注记 · 模型</span></div><p class="mut">验证注记 · 模型</p><p>gpt-6-luna</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-71a096663e4f0fa1"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">验证注记 · Provider</span></div><p class="mut">验证注记 · Provider</p><p>openai-codex</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-ab298f35ba1ec679"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">输入状态 · 状态</span></div><p class="mut">输入状态 · 状态</p><p>partial</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-4a946cbbdd20b5fd"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">输入状态 · as_of</span></div><p class="mut">输入状态 · as_of</p><p>20261008</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-c9b1cfd27fa00526"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">输入状态 · 阻断</span></div><p class="mut">输入状态 · 阻断</p><p>false</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-c30185d1550d6c2e"><di