"claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>净买源1按当日榜行取值，多原因同票不累加，区间累计榜剔除。</p></div></section><section id="tiers"><h2>四 席位分档库</h2><div class="card"><b>当日组件缺失</b><p>SEATLIB：当日权威机器源缺失</p></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-lhb-aeff112c7f274100"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-f5d3b25cdfa32e7e"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>训练窗口20260401~20260930；S/A/P/B/C分布{&quot;P&quot;: 165, &quot;B&quot;: 131, &quot;C&quot;: 80, &quot;A&quot;: 46, &quot;S&quot;: 19}；全体执1胜率基准49.3%。胜率源样本窗20260401-20260703，只作历史参照。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-cf495e34e6f8b0d6"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>净买占比因子状态=有效（质量库样本4607；历史有效不等于目标票可荐）。</p></div></section><section id="research"><h2>五 自主深挖 · 席位孵化</h2><div class="card"><div class="" id="claim-lhb-ebe698120a3c8443"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">深挖 · 主题</span></div><p class="mut">深挖 · 主题</p><p>S/A席位参与与股票级净买分开验证</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-d3b152e2a37e99b7"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">深挖 · 结论</span></div><p class="mut">深挖 · 结论</p><p>满足技能阈值的S/A净买7笔、合计1.7263亿元，净额是席位买方前五口径；它不能代替lhb.csv股票级净买，且不能把仅一席或上榜涨幅当成多档共振。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-665da9539fd9846e"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">深挖 · 机械结算</span></div><p class="mut">深挖 · 机械结算</p><p>逐笔复核(代码,席位)去重、档值、净额&gt;0、买入额≥1000万元，并与源1当日榜和机器双源逐代码交叉。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-2567593429f19f10"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">深挖 · 主题</span></div><p class="mut">深挖 · 主题</p><p>双源清单硬过滤</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-a1265e82f1289180"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">深挖 · 结论</span></div><p class="mut">深挖 · 结论</p><p>目标日机器列出7只强矛盾；按技能强矛盾标禁入荐票。仅源2买侧金额不翻转源1净卖方向。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-78fe77aee4782c0c"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">深挖 · 机械结算</span></div><p class="mut">深挖 · 机械结算</p><p>次日票级判断仍以股票级当日榜净买和新的双源状态为准；源2没有卖出前五，禁止把买侧总量写成完整资金净流入。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-cf6830d4a1ad421e"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">深挖 · 主题</span></div><p class="mut">深挖 · 主题</p><p>环境/缓存可用性</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-a6a6e016a5558957"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">深挖 · 结论</span></div><p class="mut">深挖 · 结论</p><p>市场涨跌停/炸板显示分化扩散，但成交额与官方资金温度空缺；对于K线缓存未更新到目标日的标的，位置判断不可用。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-c567893ee74dc3ac"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">深挖 · 机械结算</span></div><p class="mut">深挖 · 机械结算</p><p>回填仅限日后形成的目标日原始数据独立核验；不追溯性使用10月9日及以后的市场结果。</p></div><span id="claim-lhb-79bdb18161ab79fb"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-43013c7f5ff142ec"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>筛查正净买、双源未强矛盾且至少一个有效S/A的观察标的，最多列3只。任何观察票均未通过正式荐票的多席/位置/环境合取门槛。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-e2ac05baa8c47472"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><div class="obs obs-watch"><div class="obs-head">002490 山东墨龙 · 观察</div><div class="obs-rec">0.782亿元净买；一致；S/A席数1；涨跌9.9855%；目标日位置可核验=True。来源：20261008/lhb.csv、双源校验_20261008.json、席位动向/20261008.csv。不构成荐票或交易计划。</div></div></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-a5a0eb66c0b5060d"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><div class="obs obs-watch"><div class="obs-head">603248 锡华科技 · 观察</div><div class="obs-rec">0.4348亿元净买；一致；S/A席数1；涨跌4.9437%；目标日位置可核验=False。来源：20261008/lhb.csv、双源校验_20261008.json、席位动向/20261008.csv。不构成荐票或交易计划。</div></div></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-e0241c8117f85967"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><div class="obs obs-watch"><div class="obs-head">601091 沈鼓集团 · 观察</div><div class="obs-rec">0.1736亿元净买；打折；S/A席数1；涨跌4.5356%；目标日位置可核验=False。来源：20261008/lhb.csv、双源校验_20261008.json、席位动向/20261008.csv。不构成荐票或交易计划。</div></div></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-15d0706951592590"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>交易计划buys/sells为空、cash_pct=100；但模拟盘状态截至09-30，无法核验目标日实际持仓覆盖。</p></div></section><section id="cognition"><h2>六 我的认知迭代 · 最新</h2><div class="tl"><div class="card"><div class="" id="claim-lhb-685100be359c9049"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-condition">条件</span><span class="claim-source">认知迭代 · 可证伪条件</span></div><p class="mut">认知迭代 · 可证伪条件</p><p>后续如至少两只非近高标的同时出现源1正净买、双源一致、两笔以上有效S/A且位置可核验，则本日无共振判断被证伪。</p></div></div><div class="card"><div class="" id="claim-lhb-c42fdb47c1121e38"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-condition">条件</span><span class="claim-source">认知迭代 · 可证伪条件</span></div><p class="mut">认知迭代 · 可证伪条件</p><p>若目标票后续具备目标日K线、非近高且多席S/A同向，且源1/双源一致同时成立，则应重审该候选的观察评级。</p></div><span id="claim-lhb-f3a0f3af3df40962"></span></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-lhb-c7fdfc8afe38d7e2"></span></div><div class="tli" id="claim-lhb-24e5fa00eb95d942"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-cognition">认知</span><span class="claim-source">认知迭代 · 日期</span></div><p class="mut">认知迭代 · 日期</p><p>20261008</p></div><details class="chain tlfold"><summary><b>其余认知与原文证据</b><span class="chip">8条</span></summary><div class="inner"><div class="tli" id="claim-lhb-5b79995f5921f10a"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-cognition">认知</span><span class="claim-source">认知迭代 · 标题</span></div><p class="mut">认知迭代 · 标题</p><p>区分机器双源通过与票级资金确定性</p></div><div class="tli" id="claim-lhb-18019fe3cd42e093"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-cognition">认知</span><span class="claim-source">认知迭代 · 正文</span></div><p class="mut">认知迭代 · 正文</p><p>目标日双源机器状态pass，但可比58只中强矛盾7只、分歧16只；源2是买方前五线索，只有源1当日股票净买能做票级方向锚。</p></div><div class="tli" id="claim-lhb-1d79ea8c6a7957ac"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-cognition">认知</span><span class="claim-source">认知迭代 · 日期</span></div><p class="mut">认知迭代 · 日期</p><p>20261008</p></div><div class="tli" id="claim-lhb-1b7e431575cef80b"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-cognition">认知</span><span class="claim-source">认知迭代 · 标题</span></div><p class="mut">认知迭代 · 标题</p><p>高换手强势票仍须独立通过位置门禁</p></div><div class="tli" id="claim-lhb-6f1483cd8fe34421"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-cognition">认知</span><span class="claim-source">认知迭代 · 正文</span></div><p class="mut">认知迭代 · 正文</p><p>日涨幅靠近涨停或换手高不自动等于趋势位置安全；本次S/A候选出现高位、双源打折或日K缓存未对齐目标日等限制，故正式荐票为0。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-4468a62a848b923e"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-cognition">认知</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><li><div class="card"><b>区分机器双源通过与票级资金确定性</b>：目标日双源机器状态pass，但可比58只中强矛盾7只、分歧16只；源2是买方前五线索，只有源1当日股票净买能做票级方向锚。</div></li></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-2fb3930a8e34851b"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-cognition">认知</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><li><div class="card"><b>高换手强势票仍须独立通过位置门禁</b>：日涨幅靠近涨停或换手高不自动等于趋势位置安全；本次S/A候选出现高位、双源打折或日K缓存未对齐目标日等限制，故正式荐票为0。</div></li></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-ec81df3669af6d7e"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-cognition">认知</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>盲区：资金温度与成交额未取得目标日数值；源2买侧；档表/质量库窗口滞后；持仓状态陈旧；部分日K缓存陈旧。无官方全哨兵结论。</p></div></div></details></div></section><details class="chain"><summary>编辑说明与来源审计</summary><div class="inner"><ul><li>综合判断与资金温度分区呈现，席位名单、台账和分档库各归其位。</li><li>S 档小样本、反向资金与条件限定完整保留，不由重复度过滤。</li><li>当日结构化认知优先，标题是否含“我的”不影响可见性。</li></ul><div id="evidence-ev-lhb-7d06dbc1e895fbe8"><b>ev-lhb-7d06dbc1e895fbe8</b><pre>{
